message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Composite Girder Surrogate"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sandesh
    family-names: Lamsal
    email: slamsal60@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  Code, model weights, validation artifacts, and reproduction
  scripts for the paper "Stiffness Deviation of the AASHTO
  Transformed-Section Method Under Partial Composite Action and
  a Neural-Network Surrogate for Composite Steel Bridge
  Girders." Includes the OpenSeesPy fiber-section
  data-generation pipeline, a beam-level model with discrete
  shear connectors, the residual-MLP surrogate architecture,
  training and inference scripts, an MC-Dropout uncertainty
  wrapper, AASHTO and Nie-Cai comparators, baseline and
  ablation studies, and validation against published
  composite-beam tests.
keywords:
